/docs/*.md
# ...but NOT ours. The rule above is upstream's, for GZDoom's own generated
# docs, and it was silently swallowing the Realms specifications -- the six
# GAME_*.md reference manuals that the whole game port is written against, plus
# the NATIVE_*.md rules. They lived untracked for a while; a git clean would have
# taken them with no history to recover from. Keep these tracked.
!/docs/GAME_*.md
!/docs/NATIVE_*.md

